        "pf_1760005a_value": "At Colamy, we believe that the spaces we inhabit should inspire creativity and comfort. Founded with a vision to redefine modern living, our journey began in a small workshop where passion met craftsmanship.<br><br>We understand that the modern workspace is evolving. With more people working from home, the need for comfortable, functional furniture has never been greater. At Colamy， each piece is thoughtfully designed to enhance your home office experience, promoting productivity while reflecting your aesthetic.<br><br>But our story doesn’t end with furniture. We are dedicated to fostering a community that values well-being and design. By sharing tips on workspace optimization and wellness, we aspire to support our customers in creating environments where they can thrive.",
        "pf_c2f95fed_value": "Our efforts have led to significant growth. By 2024, we&nbsp;achieved annual sales of&nbsp;<strong>$80 million</strong>, with over <strong>500,000&nbsp;chairs</strong> sold and a total of <strong>11&nbsp;overseas warehouses</strong>&nbsp;established,<br>including&nbsp;&nbsp;6 in the United States.",
        "pf_1d879034_value": "A transformative year marked by comprehensive strategic realignment. We sharpened brand identity, and implemented data-driven solutions to enhance market competitiveness. In 2022, we achieving <strong>$15 million </strong>in sales this year while starting to establish overseas warehouses.",
        "pf_39b56fd2_value": "Founded in 2019, Colamy is rooted in the seating consumer goods industry, <br>with a young, pragmatic, honest, and collaborative team. Our products aim to <br>provide healthy, comfortable, and smart experiences for every family, <br>allowing them to sit comfortably and happily.",
        "pf_22a5e082_value": "We immersed ourselves in relentless learning, refining&nbsp;product quality and service systems. Through strategic&nbsp;market expansion and operational optimization, we&nbsp;earned our first wave of client trust and industry&nbsp;recognition.",
        "pf_650cde42_value": "As a startup with only a few employees, Colamy embarked on its&nbsp;journey with a shared vision of redefining home living.",
        "pf_673a1d77_value": "We aim to combine innovative design, quality craftsmanship, and <br>exceptional comfort to enhance modern living spaces.",
